    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: Take the pistol from your bedroom with E and leave the house. Follow !
    and press E to collect the next group. Bring them to the AMBER assembly area
    and press E to leave them there. Repeat for all seven, then press E and lead
    everyone to the GREEN shelter. Enter the fire truck behind the house and fill
    its tank with P at the BLUE lake marker. E exits below 20 km/h. The volcano erupts
    after 240 seconds, even if preparations are incomplete. Stop three waves of fire
    spirits and extinguish burning houses. You win if at least one house survives;
    you lose if all are destroyed. Stay away from hot lava.
